{#
    Single labeled detail row.

    Variables (required):
      label       – translation key for the row label

    Variables (one of):
      value       – plain-text value; null renders '—'
      value_html  – pre-rendered HTML (badges etc.); output unescaped

    Variables (optional):
      label_cols  – Bootstrap col class for label  (default: 'col-4')
      value_cols  – Bootstrap col class for value  (default: 'col')

    SECURITY (SEC-002): value_html is output with |raw — Twig auto-escaping is bypassed.
    The caller MUST ensure that every piece of user-controlled data embedded in value_html
    is explicitly escaped (e.g. {{ someVar|e }}) or passed only through safe Twig expressions
    (enum method calls, path(), url(), hardcoded strings).
    NEVER place a raw entity string field (user input) directly into value_html without escaping.
#}
{% set label_cols = label_cols ?? 'col-4' %}
{% set value_cols = value_cols ?? 'col' %}

<div class="detail-row row">
    <label class="{{ label_cols }} col-form-label text-secondary">{{ label|trans }}</label>
    <div class="{{ value_cols }}{% if value_html is defined %} pt-2{% endif %}">
        {% if value_html is defined %}
            {{ value_html|raw }}
        {% else %}
            {# #189: text-pre-line keeps the line breaks of multi-line values; the value stays escaped. #}
            <span class="form-control-plaintext text-pre-line text-break">{{ value ?? '—' }}</span>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</div>